title: '[[id:f6ab1c93-dbbb-433a-864a-2eaf210f8712][ZOG and KMS, Carnegie Mellon''s hypertext from the 1970s, already titled a frame by its content, split what it contains from what it only links to, and marked a link that leads nowhere]]'
pid: 66b020f4-ae26-4630-acbd-3faeaaf7c883
body: |2-
  History, read in Wikipedia and one paragraph of Grudin only; that his
  ZOG system is the one aboard the Carl Vinson is inferred. Open it for
  where skg sits among its ancestors, or when Cleo answers Ed's letter.
